WEBVTT

00:00:00.046 --> 00:00:02.937
In the conversation loop, you begin with the brain dump.

00:00:03.634 --> 00:00:06.908
Say what you are trying to accomplish, what frustrates

00:00:06.954 --> 00:00:10.286
you, who is involved, what you have tried, and what you

00:00:10.333 --> 00:00:11.413
are unsure about.

00:00:12.016 --> 00:00:13.862
You do not need a polished prompt.

00:00:14.303 --> 00:00:17.775
You can say, "I have three places where inquiries arrive,

00:00:17.949 --> 00:00:19.447
and I keep losing track.

00:00:19.958 --> 00:00:21.792
I need to see what needs a response.

00:00:22.233 --> 00:00:24.613
I am not sure whether this should send emails

00:00:24.660 --> 00:00:27.376
automatically." That uncertainty matters.

00:00:27.701 --> 00:00:30.383
It is part of the idea, not a mistake to hide.
